sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant SF as storefront (BFF)
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant R as redis-session
    participant GW as api-gateway
    B->>SF: GET /auth/sign-in?returnTo=/cart
    SF->>B: 302 to Keycloak (code flow, PKCE, state, nonce)
    B->>KC: credentials (+ OTP for staff)
    KC->>B: 302 /auth/callback?code=…
    B->>SF: callback
    SF->>KC: code + verifier + client secret
    KC->>SF: ID, access and refresh tokens
    SF->>R: store tokens sealed with AES-256-GCM
    SF->>B: Set-Cookie __Host-sid (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax), 302 /cart
    B->>SF: GET /cart (cookie)
    SF->>GW: GET /api/v1/cart, Authorization: Bearer access token
